            "nagaḥ",
            "nabhaḥ"
          ],
          "answer": "nabhaḥ",
          "note": "the rest are the mountain · nabhas is the sky",
          "source": "reference · Nature Synonyms"
        },
        {
          "id": "10-paryaya:odd:fire-dhurjati",
          "type": "choice",
          "front": "Which name does NOT belong with the others?",
          "options": [
            "vahniḥ",
            "analaḥ",
            "dahanaḥ",
            "dhūrjaṭiḥ"
          ],
          "answer": "dhūrjaṭiḥ",
          "note": "the rest are fire · dhūrjaṭi carries the matted load — Śiva",
